# A [[reindeer]] or a [[caribou]], a general term used to refer to the deer species ''[[Rangifer tarandus]]'' and its twelve subspecies.
# A short form of ''[[metsäpeura]]'', the [[Finnish forest reindeer]], ''[[Rangifer tarandus fennicus]]''.
# Any medium-sized [[deer]] of unspecified species.

